  "description": "(3.3.0) Twilio carrier adapter for CircleAI.Telephony. Number provisioning + inbound webhook configuration + outbound dial + call termination via Twilio's REST API. Media-stream WebSocket plumbing is host-supplied via IMediaStream — the ASP.NET host (CircleAI.Hosting.Telephony.Twilio) wires the WebSocket to the carrier package's session abstraction. Fail-soft when AccountSid / AuthToken missing.",
